{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "": {},
    "\"%@\" is no longer a Host in ~/.ssh/config — it won't connect. Add it back to your config, or remove it from SSH2FA (⋯ → Remove Host…).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”已不在 ~/.ssh/config 中 —— 无法连接。请加回配置文件，或从 SSH2FA 移除（⋯ → 移除主机…）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is available": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ — click ⋯ → Open in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ —— 点 ⋯ → 在访达中打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ — macOS won't ask again for this version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ —— 这个版本 macOS 不会再询问了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@, and merged into a single Keychain item — future updates will ask once instead of once per host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@,并已合并为单个钥匙串条目 —— 以后更新只会询问一次,而不是每台主机各问一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld": {},
    "%lld failed connection attempt%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$lld failed connection attempt%2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 次连接失败%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of %lld authorized. Not authorized: %@. Open each one's Password & Setup and choose “Always Allow”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$lld of %2$lld authorized. Not authorized: %3$@. Open each one's Password & Setup and choose “Always Allow”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已授权 %1$lld / %2$lld 项。未授权:%3$@。请分别打开它们的\"密码与设置\"并选择「始终允许」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已选择 %lld 项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld✗": {},
    "(no node)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（无节点）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(not a valid secret)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（不是有效的密钥）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/?token=abc123": {},
    "/scratch/you/project": {},
    "22": {},
    "2FA code unavailable — tap to retry": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法获取 2FA 验证码 —— 点按重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "8888": {},
    ":%lld": {},
    ":%lld (local) → :%lld (remote)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ":%1$lld (local) → :%2$lld (remote)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ":%lld（本地）→ :%lld（远程）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ":%lld → %@:%lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ":%1$lld → %2$@:%3$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ":%lld → %@:%lld (direct)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ":%1$lld → %2$@:%3$lld (direct)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ":%lld → %@:%lld（直连）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ":%lld → :%lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": ":%1$lld → :%2$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Actions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add 2FA secret": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加双因素密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Host": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add SSH host": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加 SSH 主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a folder you work in — mounting it takes you straight there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加你常用的文件夹——挂载后可直接进入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a host manually": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手动添加主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a tunnel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加隧道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add from ~/.ssh/config": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 ~/.ssh/config 添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高级"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After Mac sleeps, the underlying TCP for every SSH master dies. Recommended on — without it tunnels silently break with no automatic recovery.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 睡眠后，每个 SSH 主连接底层的 TCP 都会断开。建议开启 —— 否则隧道会无声中断且不会自动恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All %lld hosts authorized": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 台主机已全部授权"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All 1 host authorized": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 台主机已授权"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always-on notch status (experimental)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "常驻灵动岛状态（实验性）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appended after `http://localhost:%lld` when you click 🧭 or auto-open fires. Use this for jupyter `?token=…`, tensorboard `/#scalars`, etc.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击 🧭 或自动打开时，会附加在 `http://localhost:%lld` 之后。适合 jupyter 的 `?token=…`、tensorboard 的 `/#scalars` 等。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies the next time this tunnel starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将在此隧道下次启动时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the daemon for the next unused local port": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向后台助手请求下一个未占用的本地端口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the first time": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次使用时询问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks for Touch ID (or your Mac password) first": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会先要求 Touch ID（或你的 Mac 密码）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks for Touch ID (or your Mac password) first. Use it to set up the same account in another authenticator.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会先要求 Touch ID（或你的 Mac 密码）。可用它在另一个验证器 App 中设置同一账户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authenticating…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在验证…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authentication was cancelled or failed. Try again, or quit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证已取消或失败。请重试，或退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authorize now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即授权"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authorize saved credentials after this update": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新后请授权已保存的凭据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authorizing %@ (%lld of %lld)…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Authorizing %1$@ (%2$lld of %3$lld)…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在授权 %1$@(第 %2$lld / %3$lld 个)…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto (any ready host)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动（任一就绪主机）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto — any ready host. Click to pin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动 —— 任一就绪主机。点击可固定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-mount %@ on connect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接后自动挂载 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-scroll": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动滚动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatically check for updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动检查更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA isn't ready — quit and reopen the app. Use Troubleshoot if the problem continues.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 尚未就绪 —— 请退出并重新打开应用。如果问题仍然存在，请使用“故障排查”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Browse the host's folders instead of typing a path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览主机上的文件夹，不用手打路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Browser URL suffix": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览器网址后缀"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Browse…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built for HPC / cluster logins. You'll need your 2FA **secret key** (the TOTP setup key) — SSH2FA types the codes. It does **not** work with Duo Push / approve-on-phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "专为 HPC / 集群登录设计。你需要 2FA 的**密钥**（TOTP 设置密钥）—— 验证码由 SSH2FA 输入。它**不支持** Duo Push / 手机点确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't reach the server — check Wi-Fi or VPN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法连接到服务器 —— 请检查 Wi-Fi 或 VPN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消"
