            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空闲"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your clipboard has `ssh -L 8888:host:8888 user@node` or a localhost URL, prefill from it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果剪贴板里有 `ssh -L 8888:host:8888 user@node` 或 localhost 链接，就用它预填"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import Tunnels…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入隧道…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import hosts from your SSH config file": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从你的 SSH 配置文件导入主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Do Not Disturb, toasts don't drop a panel down — they just expand compactly around the notch (icon + a few words). Less intrusive while you work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "勿扰模式下，提示不会下拉出面板 —— 只在灵动岛周围紧凑展开（图标 + 几个字）。工作时干扰更小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Initializing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在初始化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在安装…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It answers the password + 2FA prompt for you and keeps a warm connection to each host, so ssh, scp, and your editor connect instantly with no code to type. Your password and 2FA secret are stored in the macOS Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它替你应答密码 + 2FA 提示，并为每台主机维持一个热连接，所以 ssh、scp 和你的编辑器都能立刻连上，不用输任何验证码。你的密码和 2FA 密钥保存在 macOS 钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's registered with SSH2FA, but ssh has no entry for this name — so it can't connect. Add a `Host %@` block to ~/.ssh/config, or re-add it with “Add Host” so SSH2FA manages the entry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它已在 SSH2FA 注册，但 ssh 没有这个名字的条目 —— 所以无法连接。请在 ~/.ssh/config 添加 `Host %@` 段，或用“添加主机”重新添加，由 SSH2FA 管理该条目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its saved password and 2FA secret are deleted from your Keychain, and its connection is closed. Your ~/.ssh/config is not changed. This can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它保存的密码和 2FA 密钥会从你的钥匙串中删除，连接也会关闭。你的 ~/.ssh/config 不会被修改。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JobID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "作业 ID"
          }
        }
