    "Not found as a Host in ~/.ssh/config — make sure it's a real ssh alias or a reachable hostname.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 ~/.ssh/config 中找不到该 Host —— 请确认它是真实的 ssh 别名或可达的主机名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off — the app's \"Open Terminal\" already reuses the connection. Turning this on also makes ssh <host> in your own Terminal skip the 2FA prompt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭 —— App 的“打开终端”本身已经复用连接。开启后，你在自己终端里运行 ssh <主机> 也能跳过 2FA 验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a SLURM cluster? You can also forward a local port to a compute node — see the Tunnels tab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在用 SLURM 集群？你还可以把本地端口转发到计算节点 —— 见“隧道”标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On first connect, macOS asks permission for SSH2FA to use its own saved credentials in your Keychain — click “Always Allow”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次连接时，macOS 会询问是否允许 SSH2FA 使用它自己保存在钥匙串中的凭据 —— 请点“始终允许”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On — running ssh <host> in your own Terminal reuses SSH2FA's warm connection (via one Include line added to ~/.ssh/config).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启 —— 在你自己的终端里运行 ssh <主机> 会复用 SSH2FA 的热连接（通过向 ~/.ssh/config 添加一行 Include 实现）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only TOTP codes (the kind you type) are supported — not Duo Push (approve-on-phone). Your secret is stored in the macOS Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅支持 TOTP 验证码（需要你输入的那种）—— 不支持 Duo Push（手机点确认）。你的密钥保存在 macOS 钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
