        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重启 SSH2FA 服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restarting SSH2FA…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在重新启动 SSH2FA…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Retry": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Retry after applying the suggested fix": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按建议修复后重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Retry connecting": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reveal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reveal log file…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在访达中显示日志文件…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reveal setup URL": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示设置链接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reveal the stored password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示已保存的密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run on connect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接后运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs each time this tunnel transitions to alive. Env: AUTO2FA_TUNNEL_NAME, AUTO2FA_LOCAL_PORT, AUTO2FA_NODE, AUTO2FA_JUMP, AUTO2FA_URL.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次此隧道变为存活时运行。环境变量：AUTO2FA_TUNNEL_NAME、AUTO2FA_LOCAL_PORT、AUTO2FA_NODE、AUTO2FA_JUMP、AUTO2FA_URL。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH ControlMaster pool + 2FA login + SLURM-aware port forwarding": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH ControlMaster 连接池 + 2FA 登录 + 感知 SLURM 的端口转发"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH 密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA": {},
    "SSH2FA Logs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA doesn't have permission to update itself in %@ — it may have been installed by another user.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 没有权限在 %@ 中更新自己 —— 它可能是由另一个用户安装的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA is free & open source. The one missing piece is an Apple Developer membership ($99/yr). With it the app can be notarized — it installs with zero Gatekeeper warnings for everyone, plus signed updates and a Homebrew cask that just works. If SSH2FA saves you the daily 2FA dance, chip in toward the $99.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 是免费开源的。唯一缺的是 Apple 开发者会员（每年 99 美元）。有了它 App 就能完成公证 —— 所有人安装时都不会有 Gatekeeper 警告，还能有签名更新和开箱即用的 Homebrew cask。如果 SSH2FA 帮你省掉了每天的 2FA 折腾，欢迎为这 99 美元出一份力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA is locked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 已锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA is running from a read-only location (probably still inside the disk image). Drag it to your Applications folder first, then updates install with one click.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 正在只读位置运行（多半还在磁盘映像里）。请先把它拖到\"应用程序\"文件夹，之后更新就能一键完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA manages this host's ssh config entry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此主机的 ssh 配置条目由 SSH2FA 管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 上的 SSH2FA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA refers to each host by its ~/.ssh/config alias. Add your first one and enter its password + 2FA secret — that's it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 通过 ~/.ssh/config 中的别名来识别每台主机。添加第一台并输入密码 + 2FA 密钥，就这么简单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your password and 2FA secret stay in the macOS Keychain, locked to SSH2FA. Its signed identity stays stable across updates, so macOS does not need to authorize it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的密码和 2FA 密钥保存在 macOS 钥匙串中，并仅供 SSH2FA 使用。它的签名身份在更新后保持稳定，因此 macOS 无需再次授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA needs to move older saved credentials into its new stable Keychain vault. macOS may ask permission to read the old items one final time; choose Allow. After migration, future updates will not ask again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 需要把旧版保存的凭据迁移到新的稳定钥匙串保险库。macOS 可能会最后一次请求读取旧条目；请选择“允许”。迁移完成后，后续更新不会再次询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存"
          }
        }
      }
