    "The download didn't match the checksum GitHub published — it may have been corrupted in transit. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载内容与 GitHub 公布的校验和不一致 —— 可能在传输中损坏了。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download didn't match SSH2FA's signed checksum, so it wasn't installed. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载内容与 SSH2FA 签名的校验和不一致，因此没有安装。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download failed with HTTP %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载失败，HTTP %lld。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded app failed macOS's signature check, so it wasn't installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的应用未通过 macOS 的签名校验，因此没有安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded app is missing its version information.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的应用缺少版本信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first one is what plain “Mount” uses.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一个是“挂载”默认使用的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first one is what plain “Mount” uses. “Auto” mounts it as soon as the host connects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一个是“挂载”默认使用的文件夹。“自动”会在主机连上后立即挂载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host name could not be resolved. Check HostName and connect the required VPN/DNS, then retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法解析主机名。请检查 HostName，并连接所需的 VPN/DNS，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server identity key changed. Verify its fingerprint with the server administrator before updating known_hosts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器身份密钥已更改。在更新 known_hosts 前，请先向服务器管理员核对新指纹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server is connected but refused a new SSH session. Close old SSH sessions; if it persists, ask the server administrator to check MaxSessions/PAM limits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器已连接，但拒绝建立新的 SSH 会话。请关闭旧的 SSH 会话；若仍旧如此，请联系服务器管理员检查 MaxSessions/PAM 限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server rejected the 2FA code. Check the saved secret and the Mac’s date/time, then update it in Password & setup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器拒绝了两步验证码。请检查已保存的密钥和 Mac 的日期/时间，然后在\"密码与设置\"中更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server rejected the password. Open Password & setup, replace it, then run Test login.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器拒绝了密码。请打开\"密码与设置\"替换密码，然后运行\"测试登录\"。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stored 2FA secret can't be read": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存的 2FA 密钥无法读取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build isn't running from an app bundle, so it can't update itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个版本不是从 .app 应用包里运行的，无法自我更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This update doesn't have a valid SSH2FA signature, so it wasn't installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此更新没有有效的 SSH2FA 签名，因此没有安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tighter row height + smaller font for the tunnel table. Helpful when you have more than 10 tunnels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道表格使用更紧凑的行高和更小的字体。隧道超过 10 条时很有用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too many SSH keys were tried first. Enable IdentitiesOnly for this host or remove unused keys from ssh-agent, then retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先尝试了过多 SSH 密钥。请为该主机启用 IdentitiesOnly，或从 ssh-agent 中移除不用的密钥，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Triggers once per tunnel transition idle → alive. If your tunnel hosts a notebook server (jupyter etc.), this saves you a click.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道每次从空闲变为存活时触发一次。如果隧道上跑的是 notebook 服务（如 jupyter），可以省你一次点击。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA couldn't restore its background connection. Quit and reopen SSH2FA, then use Troubleshoot if the problem continues.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 无法恢复后台连接。请退出并重新打开 SSH2FA；如果问题仍然存在，请使用“故障排查”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA couldn't identify that release safely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 无法安全识别该版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH2FA couldn't verify this update's signature.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH2FA 无法验证此更新的签名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Troubleshoot": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "排查问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try a one-shot login with the stored credentials (no effect on your live connection)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用已存储的凭据做一次性登录测试（不影响你当前的连接）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tunnel actions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tunnel state changes appear as toasts over the notch. This controls ONLY the notch — failures still show in the dashboard, and macOS notifications still fire when SSH2FA isn't frontmost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道状态变化会在灵动岛上以提示显示。此项仅控制灵动岛 —— 失败仍会显示在面板中，SSH2FA 不在前台时 macOS 通知也照常发出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tunnels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tunnels forward a local port to a **SLURM compute node** (e.g. a Jupyter server) over your warm SSH connection — and auto-recover when the node or your network changes.\n\nIf you just want no-retype 2FA SSH, you don't need this — your hosts already work in the Hosts list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道会通过你已建立的 SSH 连接，把本地端口转发到 **SLURM 计算节点**（比如 Jupyter 服务），并在节点或网络变化时自动恢复。\n\n如果你只想要免重复输入的 2FA SSH，用不到这个 —— 你的主机在“主机”列表里已经能用了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off & remove the Include": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭并移除 Include"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on (backs up config, adds one Include line)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启（会备份配置并添加一行 Include）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two-factor secret": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双因素验证密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type a command…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入命令…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo": {
