        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查更新失败：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update from Terminal instead": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改用终端命令更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update with ONE of these (SSH2FA never installs on its own):": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用以下任一方式更新（SSH2FA 绝不会自行安装）："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use jump host": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用跳板机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用所选"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this after changing your password on the server. SSH2FA can't detect that change on its own — logins keep failing until the stored password matches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在服务器上改过密码后用这里更新。SSH2FA 无法自行察觉这个变化 —— 在存储的密码对上之前，登录会一直失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用户"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Username": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warm connection reuse": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "热连接复用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warning: %@ is not in ~/.ssh/config and won't connect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告：%@ 不在 ~/.ssh/config 中，无法连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to SSH2FA": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 SSH2FA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When any tunnel is alive or transitioning, a small persistent indicator sits over the notch. Click for the full toast. Off by default — can be visually busy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当有隧道存活或正在切换状态时，灵动岛上会常驻一个小指示器。点击可查看完整提示。默认关闭 —— 可能会显得杂乱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which terminal app a host's “Open Terminal” action launches and SSHes in with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机的“打开终端”操作使用哪个终端 App 来启动并 SSH。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whole filesystem (/)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整个文件系统 (/)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why sponsor? Hover for the goal — click to open Ko-fi ♥": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为什么赞助？悬停查看目标 —— 点击打开 Ko-fi ♥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With auto-connect on, the daemon attempts login for this host every time it starts (or every time the app launches it).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启自动连接后，后台助手每次启动（或每次由 App 启动）都会尝试登录此主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're on the latest version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已是最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your 2FA app is seeded by a secret. You need that secret (a base32 string) or the full otpauth:// URL it came from. To reveal it:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 2FA App 是由一个密钥生成的。你需要这个密钥（一串 base32）或它对应的完整 otpauth:// 链接。获取方法："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your login Keychain is locked — unlock it (log out and back in, or open Keychain Access) and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的登录钥匙串已锁定 —— 请解锁（注销后重新登录，或打开“钥匙串访问”）后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cluster username (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "集群用户名（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "direct": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直连"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "e.g. lab server, gpu cluster": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：实验室服务器、GPU 集群"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "filter (host name, error keyword, …)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "筛选（主机名、错误关键词…）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "github.com/gasvn/ssh2fa": {},
    "gpunode8a11103.hpc.example.edu": {},
    "iTerm": {},
    "jupyter": {},
    "login.example.edu": {},
    "login.hpc.example.edu": {},
    "login01.example.edu": {},
    "macOS didn't allow access to the saved credential. Try again and choose “Always Allow” on the Keychain prompt — then it won't ask again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 未允许访问已保存的凭据。请重试，并在钥匙串弹窗上选择“始终允许”—— 之后就不会再问了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS didn't allow access to the saved credentials. Open a host's Password & Setup, try again, and choose “Always Allow”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 没有放行对已存凭据的访问。请打开任一主机的\"密码与设置\"重试,并选择「始终允许」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS hasn't allowed access yet — a Keychain prompt may be waiting for you. Choose “Always Allow” there, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 还未授予访问权限 —— 可能有一个钥匙串弹窗在等你。请在上面选择“始终允许”，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS is running SSH2FA from a temporary read-only copy. Move the app to your Applications folder and open it from there, then updates install with one click.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 正在以一份临时只读副本运行 SSH2FA。请把应用移到\"应用程序\"文件夹，并从那里打开，之后更新就能一键完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS is still asking every time. That happens when “Allow” is chosen instead of “Always Allow” — “Allow” permits one single use. Next time the prompt appears, choose “Always Allow” and it will stop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 仍然每次都在询问。这通常是因为点了「允许」而不是「始终允许」——「允许」只放行这一次。下次弹出时请选「始终允许」,就不会再问了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "name (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
